{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_APPLICATIONLEVELERRORHANDLING_SECTION_10_3_1_4_OSRestartTask","src":"manifest","doc":"ApplicationLevelErrorHandling","page":61,"text":"10.3.1.4 OSRestartTask\nThe OSRestartTask is a task which is started when the Protection Hook returns\nPRO_TERMINATEAPPL_RESTART. When this task is executing it will be the only task\nrunning in the partition. The contents of the OSRestartTask are not standardized by\nAUTOSAR.\nIn the OSRestartTask, one can perform any cleanup activities necessary for being able\nto terminate or restart a partition. It should be noted that even though the task is named\nOSRestartTask, there is no automatic restart of the OS-Application (or the OS for that\nmatter). During the execution of the OSRestartTask, there is still an active decision to\nmake whether to terminate or restart the OS-Application (and thereby the partition).","caption":"10.3.1.4 OSRestartTask","sha":null,"series":[{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_APPLICATIONLEVELERRORHANDLING_SECTION_10_3_1_4_OSRestartTask","releases":["4.0.3"],"page":62,"hash":"09b355044ae17ac4","caption":""},{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_APPLICATIONLEVELERRORHANDLING_SECTION_10_3_1_4_OSRestartTask","releases":["4.1.3"],"page":61,"hash":"3638128fd376038d","caption":""},{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_APPLICATIONLEVELERRORHANDLING_SECTION_10_3_1_4_OSRestartTask","releases":["4.2.2"],"page":61,"hash":"bf4a94792d9e9454","caption":""},{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_APPLICATIONLEVELERRORHANDLING_SECTION_10_3_1_4_OSRestartTask","releases":["4.3.1"],"page":61,"hash":"ba87bfc87db77c12","caption":""},{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_APPLICATIONLEVELERRORHANDLING_SECTION_10_3_1_4_OSRestartTask","releases":["R19-11"],"page":60,"hash":"17ec5d3cf0d213f5","caption":""},{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_APPLICATIONLEVELERRORHANDLING_SECTION_10_3_1_4_OSRestartTask","releases":["R20-11"],"page":61,"hash":"ffd0b8536dd03974","caption":""},{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_APPLICATIONLEVELERRORHANDLING_SECTION_10_3_1_4_OSRestartTask","releases":["R21-11"],"page":61,"hash":"a263b50c5adf505e","caption":""}],"releases":["R19-11","R20-11","R21-11","4.0.3","4.1.3","4.2.2","4.3.1"],"kind":"snippet","platform":"classic","targets":[{"role":"heuristic","conf":0.8,"rt":"","m":"gemini-3.8-flash","why":"OsRestartTask activation upon application restart","rel":[],"id":"SWS_Os_00111"},{"role":"heuristic","conf":0.8,"rt":"","m":"gemini-3.8-flash","why":"Protection hook returns PRO_TERMINATEAPPL_RESTART","rel":[],"id":"SWS_Os_00555"},{"role":"heuristic","conf":0.7,"rt":"","m":"gemini-3.8-flash","why":"PRO_TERMINATEAPPL_RESTART requires configured OsRestartTask","rel":[],"id":"SWS_Os_00557"}],"ok":true,"schema":"versions-explorer@1"}